# Project Agent · prompt-builder secrets · TEMPLATE
#
# Real file lives at /etc/prompt-builder/secrets.env on the VPS,
# mode 0600 root:root. Loaded via systemd EnvironmentFile= in
# prompt-builder.service. Never check the real values in.
#
# To rotate any key in production:
#   1. SSH to VPS as root
#   2. vim /etc/prompt-builder/secrets.env  (or sed -i to swap in place)
#   3. systemctl restart prompt-builder
#   4. Verify: curl -sS http://localhost:8200/clients/active
#
# To audit who can read the file:
#   ls -la /etc/prompt-builder/secrets.env       # must be -rw------- root root
#   getfacl /etc/prompt-builder/secrets.env       # no ACLs grant other readers
#
# To watch reads with auditd (recommended for production):
#   auditctl -w /etc/prompt-builder/secrets.env -p rwxa -k pb_secrets
#   ausearch -k pb_secrets

# ── Inference providers ────────────────────────────────────────────────
